# Raw client asset dump (source-of-truth photography and 4K exhibition footage).
# Web-ready derivatives live in site/assets/products and site/assets/exhibition;
# the originals include files far above GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# Leading slash is required: git is case-insensitive here (core.ignorecase=true),
# so an unanchored "PRODUCTS/" would also ignore site/products/.
/PRODUCTS/
